<title>ARGENTINA: TABLE-ARGENTINA'S MOLINOS Q2 NET $12.12 MLN.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ARGENTINA'S MOLINOS Q2 NET $12.12 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Molinos Ro de la Plata SA reported net income of $12.12 million for the three months ended June 30. The company provided no comparative nor EPS information.</p>
<p>It reported a net worth of $340.5 million and retained earnings of $90 million.</p>
<p>((-Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
